N5008 [temp.class.spec.match] + [temp.variadic].  A recursive class template over
a NON-type parameter pack, selected via its `<H, T...>` partial specialization,
folds at 0/1/2/3/4 elements.  Previously failed at exactly two elements: the
nested `sum_t<3>` (empty deduced trailing pack) re-type-checked its pattern
`<H, T...>` with the non-type `T...` still present and threw, falling back to the
incomplete primary.  Fixed by trimming the empty deduced trailing pack before the
pattern re-type-check.  Non-vacuous: the two-element assertion is the former
failure point.
